  "conclusion": "The complete matrix contains 90/90 dataset \u00d7 LLM \u00d7 method cells. Positive steering exceeds baseline in 78/90 cells, negative steering falls below baseline in 87/90, and the expected signed ordering holds in 78/90; Gemma and Pythia are reported separately.",
